<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
<content>
<section id="fs-id1165137733672">
<title> Extension</title>
<exercise id="fs-id1165137442197">
<problem id="fs-id1165133221851">
<para id="fs-id1165133221853">Suppose the range of a function <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>f</m:mi></m:mrow>
</m:math> is <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>−5</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math> What is the range of <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>|</m:mo><m:mo>?</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165134555582">
<para id="fs-id1165134555584"> <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mo stretchy="false">[</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.5em"/><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo stretchy="false">]</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>

<exercise id="fs-id1165137679047">
<problem id="fs-id1165137679049">
<para id="fs-id1165133410011">Create a function in which the range is all nonnegative real numbers.</para>
</problem>
</exercise>

<exercise id="fs-id1165135209378">
<problem id="fs-id1165135209380">
<para id="fs-id1165137645593">Create a function in which the domain is <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>&gt;</m:mo><m:mn>2.</m:mn></m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1165133210812">
<para id="fs-id1165137779064">Many answers. One function is <m:math>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>f</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mfrac>
<m:mn>1</m:mn>
<m:mrow>
<m:msqrt>
<m:mrow>
<m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow>
</m:msqrt>
</m:mrow>
</m:mfrac>
<m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow>
</m:math>
</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</section>
</content>
</document>
